### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA
### Create a study session
POST http://localhost:8080/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Spring Boot Day 3",
  "track": "Internship Prep",
  "durationMinutes": 180,
  "date": "2026-08-18",
  "wasUninterrupted": true,
  "notes": "Built full CRUD API with DI and H2"
}
### Get all sessions
GET http://localhost:8080/sessions

###

### Get session by id
GET http://localhost:8080/sessions/1

###

### Update session 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/sessions/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Spring Boot Day 3 - Updated",
  "track": "Internship Prep",
  "durationMinutes": 200,
  "date": "2026-08-18",
  "wasUninterrupted": false,
  "notes": "Extended session, got interrupted once"
}

###

### Delete session 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/sessions/2

